    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_TowerGraves_Text_Grave",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "Trainer: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_PokemonTower_2F_Text_RivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "What brings you here?\f",
        "Is your Pokémon dead?\r",
        "Hey! It’s alive!\r",
        "I can at least make them faint!\n",
        "Let’s go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_PokemonTower_2F_Text_RivalPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "How’s your Pokédex coming?\n",
        "I just caught a Cubone!\r",
        "I can’t find the bigger Marowak.\n",
        "Where could they be?\r",
        "I bet there aren’t any left!\r",
        "Hey… has Gramps been weird to you\n",
        "lately?\r",
        "He keeps asking me how many\n",
        "approvals I have. And about the\f",
        "Gym. Never about my Pokédex.\r",
        "…Whatever. I better get going.\n",
        "I’ve got a lot to accomplish,\f",
        "unlike you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_TowerGraves_Text_GirlLament",
      "en_US": [
        "…You found all ten of them.\r",
        "Ten little ones who never grew up.\n",
        "Nobody ever reads their names.\r",
        "Everyone wants their Pokémon\n",
        "to evolve. Bigger. Stronger.\r",
        "But I always wondered…\r",
        "When it evolves, what happens\n",
        "to the little one it used to be?\r",
        "Is it still in there somewhere?\n",
        "Or does it just… go away?\r",
        "…Does it die?\r",
        "My Scyther never changed.\n",
        "Not once. And it’s still here.\f",
        "Still with me.\r",
        "You remembered them as they were.\n",
        "So this is yours now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_TowerGraves_Text_GirlKeepThemAsTheyAre",
      "en_US": [
        "Let a Pokémon that hasn’t evolved\n",
        "hold it. It’ll hit so much harder.\r",
        "Keep your Pokémon as it is.\r",
        "It’s powerful enough.\n",
        "It always was…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_TowerGraves_Text_Gone",
      "en_US": "…The girl and her Scyther were gone."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_GymHack_Text_RivalGoldCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh yeah, catch!\r",
        "Gramps gave me a pile of these for\n",
        "our Gym audition."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_GymHack_Text_RivalGoldCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "A Gold Bottle Cap maxes out All of\n",
        "a Pokémon’s stats.\r",
        "My team doesn’t need it.\n",
        "They’re perfect already!\r",
        "I just don’t want to hear you say\n",
        "you lost because your team was weak.\r",
        "Smell ya later!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_TowerGraves_Text_GirlNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "…Your bag is too full to hold it.\r",
        "Come back to them.\n",
        "I’ll be waiting…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may hold the same item.\r",
        "More than one is holding\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Take one off and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0886_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_2F_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
